{"about_the_game":"<strong>Farmtale is a farming idle clicker hybrid with focus on building, customization, and management.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231520/extras/7909f75d249b1136c8fd70047e6e0b55.poster.avif?t=1624902951\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231520/extras/7909f75d249b1136c8fd70047e6e0b55.webm?t=1624902951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231520/extras/7909f75d249b1136c8fd70047e6e0b55.mp4?t=1624902951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>On a deserted Island, you start with enough coins to buy a chicken. Collect eggs, chop trees, gather materials, and catch fish to gain enough income to expand your farming adventure. Build, explore, and decorate in a colorful world full of interactions. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231520/extras/3e1602bffec6e08eb49ba6b372a135a1.avif?t=1624902951\" width=618 height=73 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Sandbox Building</strong> \u2013 From crops to livestock, you choose your own type of farm. <br></li><li> <strong>Animals and Crops</strong> - Buy different animals and crops, and market a variety of products such as meat, eggs, milk, potatoes, pumpkins, pineapples and more.<br></li><li> <strong>Workers</strong> \u2013 Hire different types of farmers to manage your ever-expanding farming plot.<br></li><li> <strong>Upgrades and Items</strong> - With hundreds of upgrades and items available, boost your livestock, crops, workers or buildings as you please.<br></li><li> <strong>Customize Your Farm</strong> - Free your creativity with plenty of decorations for your farm buildings - and even animals!<br></li><li> <strong>Achievements and Quests</strong> \u2013 Complete achievements and quests as you progress to earn exclusive rewards!<br></li><li> <strong>Recycle and Refine</strong> \u2013 Not everything you find will be useful. Recycle items you don't need and spend your materials on something else!</li></ul><br>We appreciate all types of feedback, positive and constructive. Feel free to join our wholesome community on Discord for latest updates and news!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bae92ceee0664bebb2b6ce09559f9281b5395f31.jpg","localized_name":"King of Farming","name":"King of Farming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1231520/bae92ceee0664bebb2b6ce09559f9281b5395f31.jpg"},{"icon":"00e9b5cfa50c4de62817447e6cdc9400c06a7b2f.jpg","localized_name":"Lord of Poultry-Yard","name":"Lord of Poultry-Yard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1231520/00e9b5cfa50c4de62817447e6cdc9400c06a7b2f.jpg"},{"icon":"a52f99fed0677acfb6c85949175e056a7b5beea1.jpg","localized_name":"Duck Island","name":"Duck Island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1231520/a52f99fed0677acfb6c85949175e056a7b5beea1.jpg"},{"icon":"f490b31c1ea6732dab6a7e408a362be862aa6ea0.jpg","localized_name":"Rabbit Hotel","name":"Rabbit Hotel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1231520/f490b31c1ea6732dab6a7e408a362be862aa6ea0.jpg"},{"icon":"4f3a177216a152aa60ac91aafb2e009d2b54cd8a.jpg","localized_name":"Cow Town","name":"Cow Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1231520/4f3a177216a152aa60ac91aafb2e009d2b54cd8a.jpg"},{"icon":"17e8bb7d2df675ad2f09340d3c645e71872237b3.jpg","localized_name":"Fancy Paddock","name":"Fancy Paddock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1231520/17e8bb7d2df675ad2f09340d3c645e71872237b3.jpg"},{"icon":"89473821a02d0b0e5f9584a177671ef56bb2df60.